{1}{East of here is the vault room, if my memories are good.}{East of here is the vault room, if my memories are good.}{}{}{}{}
{2}{I remember the royal armory lying south of here. I think the corridor to the east leads to the old chapel.}{I remember the royal armory lying south of here. I think the corridor to the east leads to the old chapel.}{}{}{}{}
{3}{I know there's a secret door in the room south of this crossing.}{I know there's a secret door in the room south of this crossing.}{}{}{}{}
